#### Example (fast-check / TypeScript)

```ts
// round-trip property: decode(encode(m)) === m for all messages
fc.assert(fc.property(arbitraryMessage(), (m) => {
  expect(decode(encode(m))).toEqual(m);
}), { seed: 42 });
```
